    <string name="hokm_rule_one_title">Before the hand</string>
    <string name="hokm_rule_one">For a regular hand, each team bids the tricks it expects to win. The bids must add up to at least the number of tricks in the hand. For a forced hand, Yar uses the bids set in the game settings.</string>
